   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Rivers Fund IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Rivers Fund IV (&#x201C;ARF IV&#x201D;), a Mauritius limited partnership, is targeting US$135 million to construct a portfolio of investments diversified in Central and East Africa, which collectively capture the underserved small and medium-sized enterprises (&#x201C;SMEs&#x201D;). ARF IV&#x2019;s investment objective is to provide long-term financing to SMEs through self-liquidating instruments, including straight debt, debt with revenue-sharing, and debt with equity.</narrative>
  </description>
